OL,3,AUS envoys set for Ukraine talks after
OL,4,Ameeting Putin in Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo US envoys are hoping for "equally
OL,7,Fproductive meetings" in Ukraine after
OL,8,Fholding talks with Russian President
OL,9,FVladimir Putin in Moscow on ending the
OL,10,Fwar, US officials say.
OL,12,FSteve Witkoff and Jared Kushner are set
OL,13,Fto land in Kyiv on Sunday, having
OL,14,F"discussed substantive plans for next
OL,15,Fsteps" with Putin on Saturday,
OL,16,Faccording to the White House.
OL,18,FIt is not yet clear exactly what they
OL,19,Fare, but an announcement is expected in
OL,20,Fthe coming weeks, as efforts to end the
OL,21,Fwar in Ukraine gather pace.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
